{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T00:30:25+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Poly Memory: Predators", "steam_appid": 2133250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poly Memory: Predators</strong> is a cute, relaxing <strong>memory matching puzzle game</strong> featuring fascinating predatory animals, colorful pictures, and distinctive <strong>polygonal artwork</strong>. Reveal hidden cards, remember their positions, and find identical pairs across <strong>50 levels</strong> of classic memory gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a charming <strong>animal-themed matching game</strong> that combines visual memory, observation, and concentration with relaxing background music.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Flip the Cards. Remember the Pictures. Find the Pairs.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your memory skills to the test in a collection of engaging <strong>predator-themed memory puzzles</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level contains hidden cards decorated with pictures of different predatory animals. Every picture has an identical match somewhere on the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal <strong>two cards at a time</strong> and carefully remember the images and their positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you discover two identical cards, they disappear from the playing field. If the cards do not match, remember what you have seen and use that knowledge to find their matching pictures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find every matching pair to clear the board and complete each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793918670\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de1