m/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793918670\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793918670\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793918670\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793918670\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793918670\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793918670\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793918670\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793918670\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793918670\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793918670\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fascinating Predators and Colorful Polygonal Art</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a collection of <strong>predatory animal pictures</strong> presented in a charming polygonal art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The colorful illustrations bring variety to the familiar memory matching experience, making every card reveal part of an enjoyable puzzle-solving challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you enjoy <strong>animal memory games</strong>, wildlife-themed puzzles, or classic card matching gameplay, Poly Memory: Predators offers a relaxing experience built around observation, concentration, and visual memory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >50 Levels of Relaxing Memory Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through <strong>50 levels</strong> of classic <strong>picture matching gameplay</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the cards, remember where each animal picture appears, and find identical pairs to complete the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With intuitive mouse controls and calming background music, you can enjoy the puzzles at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time, concentrate on the pictures, and enjoy the satisfaction of finding every matching pair.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 levels</strong> – Complete a collection of predator-themed memory matching puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic memory gameplay</strong> – Reveal cards, remember pictures, and find identical pairs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two-card matching</strong> – Open up to two cards at a time to discover matching images.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden picture puzzles</strong> – Remember the positions of cards after they turn face down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Matching pairs disappear</strong> – Clear the board by finding every identical pair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Predatory animal pictures</strong> – Discover fascinating wildlife illustrations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polygonal art style</strong> – Enjoy colorful pictures with distinctive geometric artwork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual memory challenges</strong> – Practice observation, concentration, and recall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple mouse controls</strong> – Enjoy intuitive card matching gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing music</strong> – Solve puzzles accompanied by calming background music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 Steam Achievements</strong> – Unlock achievements as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Cloud support</strong> – Synchronize supported game progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player gameplay</strong> – Enjoy memory puzzles at your own pace.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flip the cards, remember the predators, find every matching pair, and complete all 50 levels in Poly Memory: Predators!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poly Memory: Predators</strong> is a cute, relaxing <strong>memory matching puzzle game</strong> featuring fascinating predatory animals, colorful pictures, and distinctive <strong>polygonal artwork</strong>. Reveal hidden cards, remember their positions, and find identical pairs across <strong>50 levels</strong> of classic memory gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a charming <strong>animal-themed matching game</strong> that combines visual memory, observation, and concentration with relaxing background music.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Flip the Cards. Remember the Pictures. Find the Pairs.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your memory skills to the test in a collection of engaging <strong>predator-themed memory puzzles</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level contains hidden cards decorated with pictures of different predatory animals. Every picture has an identical match somewhere on the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal <strong>two cards at a time</strong> and carefully remember the images and their positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you discover two identical cards, they disappear from the playing field. If the cards do not match, remember what you have seen and use that knowledge to find their matching pictures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find every matching pair to clear the board and complete each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793918670\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793918670\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793918670\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793918670\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793918670\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793918670\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793918670\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item