picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793918670\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793918670\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793918670\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133250/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793918670\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fascinating Predators and Colorful Polygonal Art</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a collection of <strong>predatory animal pictures</strong> presented in a charming polygonal art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The colorful illustrations bring variety to the familiar memory matching experience, making every card reveal part of an enjoyable puzzle-solving challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you enjoy <strong>animal memory games</strong>, wildlife-themed puzzles, or classic card matching gameplay, Poly Memory: Predators offers a relaxing experience built around observation, concentration, and visual memory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >50 Levels of Relaxing Memory Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through <strong>50 levels</strong> of classic <strong>picture matching gameplay</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the cards, remember where each animal picture appears, and find identical pairs to complete the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With intuitive mouse controls and calming background music, you can enjoy the puzzles at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time, concentrate on the pictures, and enjoy the satisfaction of finding every matching pair.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 levels</strong> – Complete a collection of predator-themed memory matching puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic memory gameplay</strong> – Reveal cards, remember pictures, and find identical pairs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two-card matching</strong> – Open up to two cards at a time to discover matching images.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden picture puzzles</strong> – Remember the positions of cards after they turn face down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Matching pairs disappear</strong> – Clear the board by finding every identical pair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Predatory animal pictures</strong> – Discover fascinating wildlife illustrations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polygonal art style</strong> – Enjoy colorful pictures with distinctive geometric artwork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual memory challenges</strong> – Practice observation, concentration, and recall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple mouse controls</strong> – Enjoy intuitive card matching gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing music</strong> – Solve puzzles accompanied by calming background music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 Steam Achievements</strong> – Unlock achievements as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Cloud support</strong> – Synchronize supported game progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player gameplay</strong> – Enjoy memory puzzles at your own pace.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flip the cards, remember the predators, find every matching pair, and complete all 50 levels in Poly Memory: Predators!</strong></p>", "short_description": "Poly Memory: Predators is a r